  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "CubemapTexture manages the lifecycle of a cubemap texture in a WebGL environment, handling the loading of six individual face images or generating a procedural white fallback. It extends Texture and interfaces directly with WebGL2RenderingContext to create and populate the texture using gl.texImage2D. The component supports asynchronous loading via URIs, resolving upon successful fetching of all six assets, or synchronous creation via createWhiteCubemap()."
  },
